  "archetypes": {
    "01-report.md": {
      "kind": "markdown-report",
      "requirements": [
        "首行 ---，YAML frontmatter 至少 title/domain 两键，第二个 --- 后空行。",
        "一个 H1、一个 H2；H2 下依次为普通无序项、两空格嵌套无序项、一个有序项、一个未完成 checkbox、一个完成 checkbox。",
        "一个 > 引用行；一个三列表格（表头 metric|value|note，分隔行，一行数据）。",
        "一个 json 围栏块，块内恰好一行合法 JSON；一个 Markdown 链接指向 https://docs.example.org/<domain>。",
        "全文至少出现两次领域英文 term，保证 top-keywords 非空。"
      ],
      "extra_coverage": ["cod-text-top-keywords","cod-text-headings","cod-text-structure","cod-text-ordered-ratio","cod-text-link-domains","cod-text-link-domains-truncated","cod-text-code-languages","cod-text-code-languages-truncated","cod-text-section-paths","cod-text-section-paths-truncated","cod-text-table-headers","cod-text-table-headers-truncated","cod-text-bracket-balance"],
      "expect": {
        "cod-text-structure": ["frontmatter","lists","code-blocks","tables","headings"],
        "cod-text-table-blocks": 1,
        "cod-text-table-rows": 3,
        "cod-text-table-cols": 3,
        "cod-text-list-items": 5,
        "cod-text-list-nesting-max": 2,
        "cod-text-ordered-ratio": 0.2,
        "cod-text-checkboxes": 2,
        "cod-text-code-lines": 1,
        "cod-text-quote-lines": 1,
        "cod-text-link-count": 1,
        "cod-text-link-domains": ["docs.example.org"],
        "cod-text-code-languages": ["json"],
        "cod-text-table-headers": ["metric","value","note"],
        "cod-text-bracket-balance": 1
      }
    },
    "02-observation-log.txt": {
      "kind": "timestamp-log",
      "requirements": [
        "恰好 8 个物理行，每行以 2026-01-01T00:00:00 到 2026-01-01T00:00:30 的 ISO 时间戳开头，时间非递减。",
        "第 6 行与第 8 行完全相同，形成一组精确重复行；URL 和 email 分别放在两个非重复行中，各出现一次。",
        "文件以单个 LF 结尾；内容为英文。"
      ],
      "extra_coverage": ["cod-text-top-keywords","cod-text-time-span"],
      "expect": {
        "cod-text-lines": 9,
        "cod-text-timestamp-count": 8,
        "cod-text-time-span": 30,
        "cod-text-timestamp-line-ratio": 1,
        "cod-text-repeat-line-ratio": 0.25,
        "cod-text-url-count": 1,
        "cod-text-email-count": 1,
        "cod-text-eol": "lf",
        "cod-text-final-newline": true
      },
      "expected_absent_fields": ["cod-text-shebang","cod-text-headings","cod-text-structure"]
    },
    "03-collaboration-chat.txt": {
      "kind": "social-chat",
      "requirements": [
        "恰好 6 个物理行，每行以 [2026-01-01T00:00:00] 这类方括号时间戳开头，时间跨度为 120 秒。",
        "每行恰好一个空格前缀的 @mention；恰好两行各含一个空格前缀的 #hashtag。",
        "全文恰好四个 emoji；恰好一个 URL、一个 email、一个 Markdown 链接。",
        "至少两行使用中文引号对话，文件以 LF 结尾。"
